comments[2]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-08T10:32:51.895Z","harness:codex","Partial tranche evidence 2026-08-08: added the public path-redacted host errno classifier/translator/async boundary for EACCES, EDQUOT, EMFILE, ENFILE, ENOMEM, ENOSPC, EPERM, and EROFS; snapshot create/restore now consume it while preserving published snapshot error codes. Generated catalog, negative controls, 22/22 linked tests, security scan, and exact full coverage pass. Acceptance is not complete: the remaining awaited filesystem sites still need routing or explicit waivers and a CI recurrence gate. Returning this item to open and releasing the claim rather than claiming whole-repo completion."
  "2026-08-10T00:19:43.045Z","harness:codex","Live reliability evidence 2026-08-10: the 14-day release gate reports critical=0 and high=1 for Sentry group PM-CLI-2X, an unexpected ENOTDIR open fault. This is another member of the untyped host-filesystem family owned by this item; no duplicate item was created. The active SDK/CLI PR does not claim to complete this item's remaining all-call-site routing and recurrence-gate acceptance criteria, so the item remains open and unclaimed. No paths, payloads, or private endpoint data are retained here."
